<Layout
  title="Affiliate disclosure – FreshFynds"
  description="How FreshFynds earns money through affiliate links."
>
  <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>

  <p>
    FreshFynds is free to read. To keep it running, some links on this site
    are affiliate links. If you click one and buy something, the store may pay
    us a small commission. The price you pay stays the same.
  </p>

  <p>
    Commissions never decide what we recommend. A product appears in a guide
    because we think it is a good choice for Indian balcony and terrace
    gardeners, and we point out drawbacks when we know of them.
  </p>

  <p>
    Affiliate links may lead to stores such as Amazon, Flipkart and gardening
    brands' own websites, sometimes through affiliate networks that track
    purchases for us.
  </p>

